  "premium": true,
  "question": "Write an SQL query that makes recommendations using the pages that your friends liked. Assume you have two tables: a two-column table of users and their friends, and a two-column table of users and the pages they liked.\n\nIt should not recommend pages you already like.\n\nNot available: table and column names, example rows, output format and ordering rules from DataLemur's version.",
